Source: textsearch-intl
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libicu-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/benjaminsanborn/textsearch_intl

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-textsearch-intl
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-textsearch-intl
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multilingual full-text search with ICU segmentation and normalization for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 textsearch_intl provides ICU word segmentation, Unicode normalization and
 optional n-gram matching for multilingual full-text search. It requires UTF-8
 and the unaccent extension. This package contains a pinned upstream snapshot.
